doing an affiliate deal with Vora or you know one of these big fitness brands where they're selling those clothes inside the app people who are into fitness are going to be buying those things anyway can you create an experience in the app where it makes it better and then you do a rev share with the brand or create your own brand of clothing that's as good or better than these other brands and doing that inside your app.

