00:58:43,520 --> 00:58:46,960
And one of the frameworks we use at Bluethrone is really the ROI of a dollar.

663
00:58:47,040 --> 00:58:57,280
So if I have a current app and I know that if I invest one dollar into this app today, I'm going to get back, you know, $50 by month three and then $200 by month 12, whatever it might be, you have this data.

